{'symbol': 'AON', 'date': '2022-11-15 11:02:00', 'title': 'MINJEE LEE WINS THE LPGA TOUR AON RISK REWARD CHALLENGE AND $1 MILLION PRIZE', 'text': 'SEASON-LONG COMPETITION REWARDS PLAYERS WHO MAKE BETTER DECISIONS ON THE MOST STRATEGICALLY CHALLENGING HOLES ACROSS THE PGA TOUR AND LPGA TOUR PGA TOUR WINNER SCOTTIE SCHEFFLER CLAIMED EQUAL $1 MILLION PRIZE IN AUGUST NAPLES, FLA. , NOV. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AON PLC (NYSE: AON),\xa0A LEADING GLOBAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FIRM, AND THE LPGA TOUR TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MINJEE LEE HAS WON THE 2022 AON RISK REWARD CHALLENGE AND THE $1 MILLION PRIZE, THANKS TO HER PERFORMANCE USING INFORMATION AND ADVICE TO MAKE BETTER DECISIONS ON THE MOST STRATEGICALLY CHALLENGING HOLES THROUGHOUT THE SEASON-LONG COMPETITION ON THE LPGA TOUR.'}